    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498910/extras/4292b3448fcf1656cd2fdfeec99e561c.poster.avif?t=1741682273\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498910/extras/4292b3448fcf1656cd2fdfeec99e561c.webm?t=1741682273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498910/extras/4292b3448fcf1656cd2fdfeec99e561c.mp4?t=1741682273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Step into the exhilarating world of TechnoFumer, the premier third-person shooter that immerses you in the role of a daring digital hunter! This thrilling, action-packed game tasks you with the mission of tracking down and neutralizing rogue YouTube influencers. Prepare for a heart-racing adventure as you navigate through intricately designed levels, sharpening your skills to achieve the highest scores and secure extraordinary rewards.<br><br>Access all game statistics, including the Hall of Fame, daily leaderboards, total playtime, player engagement, and much more, at: <br><br><br>\ud83c\udfaf Game Objectives:<br>In TechnoFumer, your objective is clear: secure the highest score within a month to claim spectacular prizes. Explore the digital realms to locate the elusive influencers, now controlled by a mysterious digital virus, and halt their disruptive spree!<br>As the game was initially conceived as a competition, there are no checkpoints; a single death means restarting from the beginning. It requires nerves of steel to complete the game.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498910/extras/425c876841bc1fa6df60a4e101b77ce5.poster.avif?t=1741682273\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498910/extras/425c876841bc1fa6df60a4e101b77ce5.webm?t=1741682273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498910/extras/425c876841bc1fa6df60a4e101b77ce5.mp4?t=1741682273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\ud83d\udca3 Gameplay:<br>Hunt the Infected: Traverse expertly crafted levels, from urban jungles to futuristic cities, in search of the infected influencers. Face a multitude of challenges, including advanced enemy AI and strategic boss encounters.<br>Strategize to Win: Each influencer presents a unique challenge and demands a tailored strategy to overcome. Adjust your tactics dynamically and demonstrate your prowess as a marksman.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498910/extras/e1d61130ac7a1db0f808181ab5b3bc77.poster.avif?t=1741682273\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498910/extras/e1d61130ac7a1db0f808181ab5b3bc77.webm?t=1741682273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498910/extras/e1d61130ac7a1db0f808181ab5b3bc77.mp4?t=1741682273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\ud83c\udf10 Global Community:<br>Become part of a vibrant community of players. Share tips and experiences across social media platforms, engage in friendly rivalry, forge alliances, and exchange strategies to ascend as the ultimate TechnoFumer champion.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498910/extras/427e783e1bdd8de0d5c621e67470b4f6.poster.avif?t=1741682273\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498910/extras/427e783e1bdd8de0d5c621e67470b4f6.webm?t=1741682273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498910/extras/427e783e1bdd8de0d5c621e67470b4f6.mp4?t=1741682273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Are you prepared to embark on this thrilling journey and showcase your marksmanship against renowned YouTube influencers? Arm yourself, take precise aim, and conquer the TechnoFumer leaderboard today!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498910/extras/3f12f5c6120a9aa7331a3078ef7d91b8.poster.avif?t=1741682273\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498910/extras/3f12f5c6120a9aa7331a3078ef7d91b8.webm?t=1741682273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498910/extras/3f12f5c6120a9aa7331a3078ef7d91b8.mp4?t=1741682273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498910/extras/4292b3448fcf1656cd2fdfeec99e561c.poster.avif?t=1741682273\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498910/extras/4292b3448fcf1656cd2fdfeec99e561c.webm?t=1741682273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498910/extras/4292b3448fcf1656cd2fdfeec99e561c.mp4?t=1741682273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Step into the exhilarating world of TechnoFumer, the premier third-person shooter that immerses you in the role of a daring digital hunter! This thrilling, action-packed game tasks you with the mission of tracking down and neutralizing rogue YouTube influencers. Prepare for a heart-racing adventure as you navigate through intricately designed levels, sharpening your skills to achieve the highest scores and secure extraordinary rewards.<br><br>Access all game statistics, including the Hall of Fame, daily leaderboards, total playtime, player engagement, and much more, at: <br><br><br>\ud83c\udfaf Game Objectives:<br>In TechnoFumer, your objective is clear: secure the highest score within a month to claim spectacular prizes. Explore the digital realms to locate the elusive influencers, now controlled by a mysterious digital virus, and halt their disruptive spree!<br>As the game was initially conceived as a competition, there are no checkpoints; a single death means restarting from the beginning. It requires nerves of steel to complete the game.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498910/extras/425c876841bc1fa6df60a4e101b77ce5.poster.avif?t=1741682273\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498910/extras/425c876841bc1fa6df60a4e101b77ce5.webm?t=1741682273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498910/extras/425c876841bc1fa6df60a4e101b77ce5.mp4?t=1741682273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\ud83d\udca3 Gameplay:<br>Hunt the Infected: Traverse expertly crafted levels, from urban jungles to futuristic cities, in search of the infected influencers. Face a multitude of challenges, including advanced enemy AI and strategic boss encounters.<br>Strategize to Win: Each influencer presents a unique challenge and demands a tailored strategy to overcome. Adjust your tactics dynamically and demonstrate your prowess as a marksman.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498910/extras/e1d61130ac7a1db0f808181ab5b3bc77.poster.avif?t=1741682273\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498910/extras/e1d61130ac7a1db0f808181ab5b3bc77.webm?t=1741682273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498910/extras/e1d61130ac7a1db0f808181ab5b3bc77.mp4?t=1741682273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\ud83c\udf10 Global Community:<br>Become part of a vibrant community of players. Share tips and experiences across social media platforms, engage in friendly rivalry, forge alliances, and exchange strategies to ascend as the ultimate TechnoFumer champion.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498910/extras/427e783e1bdd8de0d5c621e67470b4f6.poster.avif?t=1741682273\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498910/extras/427e783e1bdd8de0d5c621e67470b4f6.webm?t=1741682273\" typ